\newlabel{tab:attrib_metrics}{{5}{15}{Attribution-reliability metrics. CRS Precision measures how often CRS-flagged steps admit a validated outcome-flipping intervention. Consensus Rate measures the fraction of CRS-flagged steps retained after multi-agent validation. \\ Note: Multi-agent consensus was computed only for GSM8K because the other benchmarks have deterministic re-executors that provide definitive success/failure outcomes. GSM8K lacks a straightforward re-executor for mathematical reasoning, so we employ LLM-based outcome prediction with stronger judge models, where multi-agent consensus provides additional verification.\relax }{table.caption.12}{}}
\newlabel{tab:attrib_metrics@cref}{{[table][5][2147483647]5}{[1][14][]15}}
